Comment: 1,0:22:31.33,0:22:33.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,GẶP SAU, SAMURAI KHÔNG GIAN...
Comment: 1,0:24:10.24,0:24:11.26,Signs,,0,0,0,,GIỚI THIỆU TẬP SAU
